"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5351040","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4465270-1846651706693256","game_id":"steam-4465270","kind":"update","title":"JUNK RUSH — SMALL PATCH, BIGGER HEADACHES","summary":"Hello, addicts of low-quality games!We're really happy to see you here with us during Steam Next Fest! And as a small thank-you, here's another patch. It's small, sure, but it fixes a few little things that have been bothering me in this version.Fixes and ImprovementsAdded new AI voice lines and increased the chance of the AI speaking. Don't forget that you can disable AI dialogue in the Audio Settings.Glass condiment jars now break when thrown at someone or shot.Removed decals from items.Fixed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T00:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693256","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465270-1846651706687295","game_id":"steam-4465270","kind":"update","title":"JUNK RUSH DEMO — ANOTHER PATCH, MORE BUGS!","summary":"Hello, creatures of the underworld!Another patch, more bugs to fix! It took a little while, but we're back with an update packed with improvements, new interactions, and fixes to make JUNK RUSH better than ever.There's still plenty of work ahead, and we know the game isn't perfect. But we're working every day to make this mess more stable and more fun. Or at least less like human waste.Here's what's new!Balance ChangesReduced the chance of NPCs throwing bombs.Reduced the bomb explosion timer fro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:48:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465270-1846651706675841","game_id":"steam-4465270","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hotdogs Are Under Control... For Now.","summary":"PATCH NOTESThe shop is finally working properly! No more issues preventing you from buying or selling items.Fixed a bug that caused item names and interaction text to disappear.Fixed an issue that prevented players from using items dropped from their inventory.Fixed stack counters getting stuck on the screen.Fixed stack values not updating correctly.Hotdog and tray interactions improved! Hotdogs now react differently depending on whether you place a tray on a hotdog, put a hotdog on a tray, or s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:06:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465270-1846018067937293","game_id":"steam-4465270","kind":"update","title":"Junk Rush Update: Light Bulbs Are No Longer Safe!","summary":"HELLO, YOU DIGITAL BUMS! Here comes another patch packed with bug fixes and new additions! UPDATE NOTESImproved Game Optimization — Your computer might finally forgive us.Breakable Light Bulbs! — You can now break light bulbs. Go ahead, discover it, test it, have fun! Just don't blame us when you're left standing in the dark.New AI Dialogue — More things for the AI to say. Lucky you!Fixed Item Rotation — Items should now rotate properly instead of doing whatever the hell they wanted.Improved Ups","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:53:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937293","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4465270-1846018067934947","game_id":"steam-4465270","kind":"announcement","title":"Junk Rush Demo: Bug Fixes & New Updates!","summary":"Hey everyone, how’s it going? Hope you’re all doing great! Now that I’ve finally figured out this Steamworks thing, here we are... After spending 48 hours trying to fix Junk Rush and starting to hallucinate from sleep deprivation, I decided to release the Demo anyway! It wasn’t exactly an accident, but I must have been hallucinating because the game was absolutely riddled with bugs. But hey, here we are, fixing everything one update at a time! Jokes aside, there were some pretty annoying issues ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T23:44:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934947","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4465270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4465270":"2026-10-26T12:30:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4465270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:54Z"},"5351040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:55Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4465270","app_id":4465270,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ffc460ae031b6f1d806ce574334c26eb04a0da550b43d9707f37c7d301